# 0.3.11 Skills model: [0] SHAPE "K<n>" ("K0" = hidden), [1] headline (first line "name level", null = hidden), [2 + 2k] name,
# [3 + 2k] level text of shown line k (null name = no line). Bridge reads only (memory): skill:fn:level present = SkyySkills loaded,
# skill:<uuid> = "Mining:12,Foraging:3,..." (SkyySkills levelsOf), skill:overall:<uuid> = Integer (SkyySkills' Overall Level, published
