# 0.3.9: the widget Group's Anchor for a box of w x h (h = the height being sent: one-line hMax, Party / Guild the drawn rows).
# Corner anchors are sent as before (Top|Bottom + Left|Right). A CENTRED axis (anchor t / b / c horizontally, l / r / c vertically,
# from Settings "Snap to") is never sent as a Horizontal: / Vertical: margin (the client does not place those where the editor
# draws the widget): it is resolved with the screenPosH maths for THIS h and sent as the nearest-edge margin (the cornerAtH
